{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22228","headline":"闭关 · 白居易","name":"闭关","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我心忘世久，世亦不我干。\n遂成一无事，因得长掩关。\n掩关来几时，髣髴二三年。\n着书已盈帙，生子欲能言。\n始悟身向老，复悲世多艰。\n回顾趋时者，役役尘壤间。\n岁暮竟何得，不如且安闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22228.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22228","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}